&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for the opportunity to provide the above estimate for your shipment. The offer is valid for 28 days and is based on the details you provided. If any of the shipment details change so may our offer to you.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Our offer does not guarantee uplift unless specified in the product type you have booked. The rate also does not include applicable surcharges, handling, taxes or other charges due carrier unless stated.&nbsp; For a list of current surcharges and handling fees refer to the latest publication of Qantas Freight Flagged Rates or confirm with your local Qantas Freight office prior to booking.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<u>If you would like to now proceed with booking and delivery: </u><br />
Please contact us Monday to Friday between the hours of 0800am and 1600pm excluding public holidays.<br />
E: <a href="mailto:johannesburgfreight@qantas.com.au">johannesburgfreight@qantas.com.au</a><br />
T: +27 11390 1176<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<u>Delivery: </u><br />
Swissport Terminal 6, Northern Perimeter Road, O R Tambo International Airport.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<u>Cut off times:</u><br />
The following minimum cut off times must be observed to avoid disruption:<br />
General (loose): 5hours prior to departure<br />
General (unit): 3hours prior to departure<br />
Express (loose): 3hours prior to departure<br />
Express (unit): 3hours prior to departure<br />
&nbsp;<br />
All shipments are subject to the Qantas Conditions of Carriage available on qantasfreight.com<br />
<br />
<strong><u>No-Show and Cancellation Fees:</u><br />
Effective 01 September 2024</strong><br />
Please note the below No-Show and Cancellation Process will be applicable for all shipments exceeding 1000KG (Not Applicable for AVI)<br />
Charge will be calculated on booked Chargeable Weight x Applicable Corresponding Rate<br />
- Day of Departure = 100% of Applicable Charge<br />
- 24 - 48 Hours Prior to Departure = 50% of Applicable Charge<br />
- 48 - 72&nbsp;&nbsp;Hours Prior to Departure = 25% of Applicable Charge<br />
- +72 Hours Prior to Departure = No Charge<br />
